=== TSFM evaluation follow-up (P5 cites → offline demo) ===
paper finding (2511.18578): off-the-shelf zero-shot TSFMs often lag strong finance baselines;
domain pretrain/fine-tune may help but still needs anti-lookahead + costs.
naive_RW     IS_CS_IC=+0.0111 IS_net_SR=-8.638 DSR(N=4)=0.000 | sealed_OOS_IC=+0.0076 OOS_net_SR=-9.723
