teach: mock_TSFM is a tiny shared linear head — NOT Chronos weights; compares protocol only.
paper-aligned caution: zero-shot / generic TSFM often ≤ strong traditional baselines on daily excess.

=== perpetual funding carry (numeric toy; offline) ===
CEX funding (CCXT-shaped): longs pay shorts when funding>0 (typical premium).
GMX (docs.gmx.io/docs/trading/fees): dominant side pays minority; rate from OI imbalance;
funding accrues continuously (per-second); do NOT overstate modify/close as the funding story.
settlement on modify/close is mainly borrow-fee + position-fee mechanics (funding also settles then).
notional=$100000 funding_8h=0.0100% (longs pay)
daily_funding_pnl_long=-30.00 USD  (negative = pay)
30d_funding_cost_long=$900.00
ann_carry_cost_long≈1095.0 bps/year if rate stays constant
regime-shift foil (10d +1bp, 10d -3bp, 10d +0.5bp) cum PnL long:
  cum_funding_pnl_long=$450.00  (sign flips with regime)
wrote CCXT-shaped mock funding CSV (structure ref only; no exchange call)
GMX-style toy: OI_long=1.20e+08 OI_short=8.00e+07 imbalance=0.200
savedFundingFactorPerSecond≈2.000e-09 (positive → longs pay; docs semantics)
