=== NautilusTrader: keep backtest and live code identical ===
source: https://nautilustrader.io/docs/latest/concepts/architecture/
Backtest / Sandbox / Live share NautilusKernel (cache, portfolio, engines, trader, clock, bus).
Strategy code should NOT branch on environment for signal logic — adapters differ, kernel same.
  [OK] signal/on_bar logic identical in backtest & live — no if env==live: tweak
  [OK] order intents via submit_order API only — no direct REST in strategy
  [OK] RiskEngine validates before venue — kernel path
  [OK] clock: backtest static vs live realtime — strategy uses clock API — injected clock
  [OK] no peeking future bars in research path — same event handlers
  [OK] recon: live ExecutionEngine vs research fills logged — paper/live gap discipline

=== base-rate-honest directional accuracy (always-up foil; arXiv:2607.12248) ===
Headline metric: excess_acc = model_accuracy - always_up_accuracy on identical windows.
bull toy: n_windows=19 always_up_acc=0.684 (~70-80% band in rising markets)
marketing_mostly_up raw_acc=0.684 vs_coin_flip=+0.184  <-- ads quote raw vs 50%
marketing_mostly_up excess_acc=+0.000  <-- honest headline; can be <=0 while raw looks high
persistence_baseline raw_acc=0.526 excess_acc=-0.158
Paper recreation spirit: always-up base ~0.70; fine-tuned model can fail to beat it (excess negative).
WARN box: ads saying '80% directional accuracy' without always-up / excess_acc are base-rate theatre.
WARN box: zero-shot Chronos/TimesFM as free equity alpha — reject; treat TSFM as prior (2606.27100).

=== crypto PIT audit before alpha (arXiv:2608.25348; Binance BTCUSDT perp spirit) ===
  [OK] no_same_bar_execution: decision at t uses only availability_time <= t; no unfinished bar
  [OK] funding_lag: realized funding not shifted backward; use event+lag assumption, test sensitivity
  [OK] no_backfill_gap_fill: do not interpolate/backward-fill gaps to manufacture continuity
  [OK] OI_publication_unverified: if OI pub time unverified, disable as alpha input (paper: OI optional)
  [OK] core_streams_trade_mark_index_funding: admit on availability-masked complete days, not silent repair
Paper negative result spirit: positive IC can still yield negative net Sharpe under costs — audit first.

=== limitations / failure modes ===
- TSFM zero-shot: weak on noisy daily excess; do not skip purge/costs/DSR.
- Mock != real Chronos/TimesFM weights; protocol transfer only.
- Base-rate trap: raw ~80% direction can be always-up; report excess_acc (2607.12248).
- TSFM as prior not alpha engine (2606.27100); reject free-equity-alpha marketing.
- Crypto: PIT audit before alpha (2608.25348) — no same-bar / funding lag / no backfill.
- Crypto survivorship: delisted perps/coins drop out of free histories.
- Funding regime shifts: carry sign flips; constant-rate ann. is a foil.
- On-chain/GMX: MEV, oracle, liquidity, bridge risks beyond CEX CCXT.
- Nautilus: identical strategy code ≠ identical fills (latency/partial/recon still differ).

